{"4567390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hop Slash", "steam_appid": 4567390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>He won't stand still</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop hops nonstop, so nothing here waits for you. Jumps, attacks and pickups all happen inside the same motion, all chained, or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.poster.avif?t=1787884639\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.webm?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.mp4?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash straight through them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skeletons only break when you hit them mid-dash. Chain an air jump into a dash-attack and you cross a gap and clear a room in the same motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.poster.avif?t=1787884639\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.webm?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.mp4?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then do it all again, faster.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level tracks your best time. Once you stop thinking about the jumps, you start thinking about the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 worlds · 12 handcrafted levels · 4 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-jump movement — steer, don't time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air jump and dash-attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hidden collectibles to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-level time records for speedrunners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support · English and Português-BR</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>He won't stand still</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop hops nonstop, so nothing here waits for you. Jumps, attacks and pickups all happen inside the same motion, all chained, or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.poster.avif?t=1787884639\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.webm?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/24a038667fe0f7a09c53ea4991eddc6a.mp4?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dash straight through them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skeletons only break when you hit them mid-dash. Chain an air jump into a dash-attack and you cross a gap and clear a room in the same motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.poster.avif?t=1787884639\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.webm?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/extras/84736b88b135e226fc0ef6df3787736d.mp4?t=1787884639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Then do it all again, faster.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level tracks your best time. Once you stop thinking about the jumps, you start thinking about the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 worlds · 12 handcrafted levels · 4 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-jump movement — steer, don't time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air jump and dash-attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hidden collectibles to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per-level time records for speedrunners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support · English and Português-BR</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Jump, slash and collect with Hop, the non-stop hopping Bunny Knight in this 3D platformer in the spirit of the N64 and PS1 classics, with a twist: he won't stand still, so chain your moves across the floating islands of Celestina.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4567390/1fa88c60c6e872a7528287bddee8bb2a14f25d56/header.jpg?t=1787884639", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.stea